{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">新田公路今日（28日）早上發生驚險交通意外，早上7時32分，一輛綠色的士沿新田公路往上水方向行駛，當駛至近石湖圍對開路段時，前方車輛因應路面狀況減速，並打起死火燈提示後車。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-28-15h12m31s619.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026bIHD9ZsDdj1790579739.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-28-15h12m31s619.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">涉事的士司機一度嘗試向左轉切線至中線，惟疑似收掣不及，直接撞向前方私家車。的士隨後以「打觔斗」方式翻滾至路肩，路面留有大量車輛碎片，場面險象環生。幸好的士翻滾期間，旁邊剛好未有其他車輛駛過。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-28-15h12m33s321.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20267mMiSlrzvn1790579745.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-28-15h12m33s321.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">意外發生後，的士司機受傷但依然清醒，事後自行撥打電話報警求助，被撞的私家車司機則感到腰痛，警方將案件列為「交通意外—有人受傷」處理。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-28T07:38:45.264781+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":249,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}